<title>USA: Value City says president Iacono resigns.</title>
<headline>Value City says president Iacono resigns.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value City Department Stores Inc said Friday George Iacono has resigned from his job as president and general merchandise manager.</p>
<p>The company said it will announce &quot;shortly&quot; successors to these jobs.</p>
<p>The company could not immediately be reached to provide information as to why Iacono resigned.</p>
</text>
